This is 4va, the 4th dimensional graphics viewer for X-Windows.
Please see the man page "4va.man" for details (to format it, use
the command "nroff -man 4va.man | ul").

All you gotta go is unpack the tar file and issue "make". It should
work, it's very simple. It even works on Linux. :)

Please send any questions or bugs to mdw1@crux2.cit.cornell.edu.

Share and Enjoy!
Matt Welsh
